# Production build context only; paths are relative to the repository root.
# Deny new top-level content until its build requirement has been reviewed.
**
!apps/
apps/**
!apps/marketing/
apps/marketing/**
!apps/marketing/package.json
!apps/marketing/package-lock.json
!apps/marketing/next.config.ts
!apps/marketing/tsconfig.json
!apps/marketing/app/
!apps/marketing/app/**
!apps/marketing/components/
!apps/marketing/components/**
!apps/marketing/lib/
!apps/marketing/lib/**
!apps/marketing/public/
!apps/marketing/public/**

# Terminal exclusions are intentionally repeated: Dockerfile-specific files replace the root policy.
